   2:../../../../../Drivers/PY32E407_HAL_Driver/Src/py32e407_hal_cortex.c ****   ******************************************************************************
   3:../../../../../Drivers/PY32E407_HAL_Driver/Src/py32e407_hal_cortex.c ****   * @file    py32e407_hal_cortex.c
   4:../../../../../Drivers/PY32E407_HAL_Driver/Src/py32e407_hal_cortex.c ****   * @author  MCU Application Team
   5:../../../../../Drivers/PY32E407_HAL_Driver/Src/py32e407_hal_cortex.c ****   * @brief   CORTEX HAL module driver.
   6:../../../../../Drivers/PY32E407_HAL_Driver/Src/py32e407_hal_cortex.c ****   *          This file provides firmware functions to manage the following 
   7:../../../../../Drivers/PY32E407_HAL_Driver/Src/py32e407_hal_cortex.c ****   *          functionalities of the CORTEX:
   8:../../../../../Drivers/PY32E407_HAL_Driver/Src/py32e407_hal_cortex.c ****   *           + Initialization and de-initialization functions
   9:../../../../../Drivers/PY32E407_HAL_Driver/Src/py32e407_hal_cortex.c ****   *           + Peripheral Control functions 
  10:../../../../../Drivers/PY32E407_HAL_Driver/Src/py32e407_hal_cortex.c ****   *
  11:../../../../../Drivers/PY32E407_HAL_Driver/Src/py32e407_hal_cortex.c ****   @verbatim  
  12:../../../../../Drivers/PY32E407_HAL_Driver/Src/py32e407_hal_cortex.c ****   ==============================================================================
  13:../../../../../Drivers/PY32E407_HAL_Driver/Src/py32e407_hal_cortex.c ****                         ##### How to use this driver #####
  14:../../../../../Drivers/PY32E407_HAL_Driver/Src/py32e407_hal_cortex.c ****   ==============================================================================
  15:../../../../../Drivers/PY32E407_HAL_Driver/Src/py32e407_hal_cortex.c **** 
  16:../../../../../Drivers/PY32E407_HAL_Driver/Src/py32e407_hal_cortex.c ****     [..]  
  17:../../../../../Drivers/PY32E407_HAL_Driver/Src/py32e407_hal_cortex.c ****     *** How to configure Interrupts using CORTEX HAL driver ***
  18:../../../../../Drivers/PY32E407_HAL_Driver/Src/py32e407_hal_cortex.c ****     ===========================================================
  19:../../../../../Drivers/PY32E407_HAL_Driver/Src/py32e407_hal_cortex.c ****     [..]     
  20:../../../../../Drivers/PY32E407_HAL_Driver/Src/py32e407_hal_cortex.c ****     This section provides functions allowing to configure the NVIC interrupts (IRQ).
  21:../../../../../Drivers/PY32E407_HAL_Driver/Src/py32e407_hal_cortex.c ****     The Cortex-M3 exceptions are managed by CMSIS functions.
  22:../../../../../Drivers/PY32E407_HAL_Driver/Src/py32e407_hal_cortex.c ****    
  23:../../../../../Drivers/PY32E407_HAL_Driver/Src/py32e407_hal_cortex.c ****     (#) Configure the NVIC Priority Grouping using HAL_NVIC_SetPriorityGrouping()
  24:../../../../../Drivers/PY32E407_HAL_Driver/Src/py32e407_hal_cortex.c ****         function according to the following table.
  25:../../../../../Drivers/PY32E407_HAL_Driver/Src/py32e407_hal_cortex.c ****     (#) Configure the priority of the selected IRQ Channels using HAL_NVIC_SetPriority(). 
  26:../../../../../Drivers/PY32E407_HAL_Driver/Src/py32e407_hal_cortex.c ****     (#) Enable the selected IRQ Channels using HAL_NVIC_EnableIRQ().
  27:../../../../../Drivers/PY32E407_HAL_Driver/Src/py32e407_hal_cortex.c ****     (#) please refer to programming manual for details in how to configure priority. 
  28:../../../../../Drivers/PY32E407_HAL_Driver/Src/py32e407_hal_cortex.c ****       
  29:../../../../../Drivers/PY32E407_HAL_Driver/Src/py32e407_hal_cortex.c ****      -@- When the NVIC_PRIORITYGROUP_0 is selected, IRQ preemption is no more possible. 
ARM GAS  C:\Users\n11ak\AppData\Local\Temp\cc4kuuJl.s 			page 2


  30:../../../../../Drivers/PY32E407_HAL_Driver/Src/py32e407_hal_cortex.c ****          The pending IRQ priority will be managed only by the sub priority.
  31:../../../../../Drivers/PY32E407_HAL_Driver/Src/py32e407_hal_cortex.c ****    
  32:../../../../../Drivers/PY32E407_HAL_Driver/Src/py32e407_hal_cortex.c ****      -@- IRQ priority order (sorted by highest to lowest priority):
  33:../../../../../Drivers/PY32E407_HAL_Driver/Src/py32e407_hal_cortex.c ****         (+@) Lowest preemption priority
  34:../../../../../Drivers/PY32E407_HAL_Driver/Src/py32e407_hal_cortex.c ****         (+@) Lowest sub priority
  35:../../../../../Drivers/PY32E407_HAL_Driver/Src/py32e407_hal_cortex.c ****         (+@) Lowest hardware priority (IRQ number)
  36:../../../../../Drivers/PY32E407_HAL_Driver/Src/py32e407_hal_cortex.c ****  
  37:../../../../../Drivers/PY32E407_HAL_Driver/Src/py32e407_hal_cortex.c ****     [..]  
  38:../../../../../Drivers/PY32E407_HAL_Driver/Src/py32e407_hal_cortex.c ****     *** How to configure Systick using CORTEX HAL driver ***
  39:../../../../../Drivers/PY32E407_HAL_Driver/Src/py32e407_hal_cortex.c ****     ========================================================
  40:../../../../../Drivers/PY32E407_HAL_Driver/Src/py32e407_hal_cortex.c ****     [..]
  41:../../../../../Drivers/PY32E407_HAL_Driver/Src/py32e407_hal_cortex.c ****     Setup SysTick Timer for time base.
  42:../../../../../Drivers/PY32E407_HAL_Driver/Src/py32e407_hal_cortex.c ****            
  43:../../../../../Drivers/PY32E407_HAL_Driver/Src/py32e407_hal_cortex.c ****    (+) The HAL_SYSTICK_Config()function calls the SysTick_Config() function which
  44:../../../../../Drivers/PY32E407_HAL_Driver/Src/py32e407_hal_cortex.c ****        is a CMSIS function that:
  45:../../../../../Drivers/PY32E407_HAL_Driver/Src/py32e407_hal_cortex.c ****         (++) Configures the SysTick Reload register with value passed as function parameter.
  46:../../../../../Drivers/PY32E407_HAL_Driver/Src/py32e407_hal_cortex.c ****         (++) Configures the SysTick IRQ priority to the lowest value 0x0F.
  47:../../../../../Drivers/PY32E407_HAL_Driver/Src/py32e407_hal_cortex.c ****         (++) Resets the SysTick Counter register.
  48:../../../../../Drivers/PY32E407_HAL_Driver/Src/py32e407_hal_cortex.c ****         (++) Configures the SysTick Counter clock source to be Core Clock Source (HCLK).
  49:../../../../../Drivers/PY32E407_HAL_Driver/Src/py32e407_hal_cortex.c ****         (++) Enables the SysTick Interrupt.
  50:../../../../../Drivers/PY32E407_HAL_Driver/Src/py32e407_hal_cortex.c ****         (++) Starts the SysTick Counter.
  51:../../../../../Drivers/PY32E407_HAL_Driver/Src/py32e407_hal_cortex.c ****     
  52:../../../../../Drivers/PY32E407_HAL_Driver/Src/py32e407_hal_cortex.c ****    (+) You can change the SysTick Clock source to be HCLK_Div8 by calling the macro
  53:../../../../../Drivers/PY32E407_HAL_Driver/Src/py32e407_hal_cortex.c ****        __HAL_CORTEX_SYSTICKCLK_CONFIG(SYSTICK_CLKSOURCE_HCLK_DIV8) just after the
  54:../../../../../Drivers/PY32E407_HAL_Driver/Src/py32e407_hal_cortex.c ****        HAL_SYSTICK_Config() function call. The __HAL_CORTEX_SYSTICKCLK_CONFIG() macro is defined
  55:../../../../../Drivers/PY32E407_HAL_Driver/Src/py32e407_hal_cortex.c ****        inside the py32e407_hal_cortex.h file.
  56:../../../../../Drivers/PY32E407_HAL_Driver/Src/py32e407_hal_cortex.c **** 
  57:../../../../../Drivers/PY32E407_HAL_Driver/Src/py32e407_hal_cortex.c ****    (+) You can change the SysTick IRQ priority by calling the
  58:../../../../../Drivers/PY32E407_HAL_Driver/Src/py32e407_hal_cortex.c ****        HAL_NVIC_SetPriority(SysTick_IRQn,...) function just after the HAL_SYSTICK_Config() function
  59:../../../../../Drivers/PY32E407_HAL_Driver/Src/py32e407_hal_cortex.c ****        call. The HAL_NVIC_SetPriority() call the NVIC_SetPriority() function which is a CMSIS funct
  60:../../../../../Drivers/PY32E407_HAL_Driver/Src/py32e407_hal_cortex.c **** 
  61:../../../../../Drivers/PY32E407_HAL_Driver/Src/py32e407_hal_cortex.c ****    (+) To adjust the SysTick time base, use the following formula:
  62:../../../../../Drivers/PY32E407_HAL_Driver/Src/py32e407_hal_cortex.c ****                             
  63:../../../../../Drivers/PY32E407_HAL_Driver/Src/py32e407_hal_cortex.c ****        Reload Value = SysTick Counter Clock (Hz) x  Desired Time base (s)
  64:../../../../../Drivers/PY32E407_HAL_Driver/Src/py32e407_hal_cortex.c ****        (++) Reload Value is the parameter to be passed for HAL_SYSTICK_Config() function
  65:../../../../../Drivers/PY32E407_HAL_Driver/Src/py32e407_hal_cortex.c ****        (++) Reload Value should not exceed 0xFFFFFF
  66:../../../../../Drivers/PY32E407_HAL_Driver/Src/py32e407_hal_cortex.c ****    
  67:../../../../../Drivers/PY32E407_HAL_Driver/Src/py32e407_hal_cortex.c ****   @endverbatim
  68:../../../../../Drivers/PY32E407_HAL_Driver/Src/py32e407_hal_cortex.c ****   ******************************************************************************
