 136:../../../../../Drivers/PY32E407_HAL_Driver/Src/py32e407_hal_cortex.c ****   * @brief  Sets the priority grouping field (preemption priority and subpriority)
 137:../../../../../Drivers/PY32E407_HAL_Driver/Src/py32e407_hal_cortex.c ****   *         using the required unlock sequence.
 138:../../../../../Drivers/PY32E407_HAL_Driver/Src/py32e407_hal_cortex.c ****   * @param  PriorityGroup: The priority grouping bits length. 
 139:../../../../../Drivers/PY32E407_HAL_Driver/Src/py32e407_hal_cortex.c ****   *         This parameter can be one of the following values:
 140:../../../../../Drivers/PY32E407_HAL_Driver/Src/py32e407_hal_cortex.c ****   *         @arg NVIC_PRIORITYGROUP_0: 0 bits for preemption priority
 141:../../../../../Drivers/PY32E407_HAL_Driver/Src/py32e407_hal_cortex.c ****   *                                    3 bits for subpriority
 142:../../../../../Drivers/PY32E407_HAL_Driver/Src/py32e407_hal_cortex.c ****   *         @arg NVIC_PRIORITYGROUP_1: 1 bits for preemption priority
 143:../../../../../Drivers/PY32E407_HAL_Driver/Src/py32e407_hal_cortex.c ****   *                                    2 bits for subpriority
ARM GAS  C:\Users\n11ak\AppData\Local\Temp\cc4kuuJl.s 			page 4


 144:../../../../../Drivers/PY32E407_HAL_Driver/Src/py32e407_hal_cortex.c ****   *         @arg NVIC_PRIORITYGROUP_2: 2 bits for preemption priority
 145:../../../../../Drivers/PY32E407_HAL_Driver/Src/py32e407_hal_cortex.c ****   *                                    1 bits for subpriority
 146:../../../../../Drivers/PY32E407_HAL_Driver/Src/py32e407_hal_cortex.c ****   *         @arg NVIC_PRIORITYGROUP_3: 3 bits for preemption priority
 147:../../../../../Drivers/PY32E407_HAL_Driver/Src/py32e407_hal_cortex.c ****   *                                    0 bits for subpriority
 148:../../../../../Drivers/PY32E407_HAL_Driver/Src/py32e407_hal_cortex.c ****   * @note   When the NVIC_PriorityGroup_0 is selected, IRQ preemption is no more possible. 
 149:../../../../../Drivers/PY32E407_HAL_Driver/Src/py32e407_hal_cortex.c ****   *         The pending IRQ priority will be managed only by the subpriority. 
